1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,901
That is the passive voice.

2
00:00:01,901 --> 00:00:03,606
It is not decoration.

3
00:00:03,606 --> 00:00:15,859
English uses it whenever the doer is unknown, obvious, unimportant or deliberately hidden, which is why notices, rules, reports and every formal letter you write need it.

